---
title: "oauthCallback - STEM OAuth PKCE Callback (AttendanceZen: Blueprint)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse: parse code, state, error from request URL
    q_parse --> q_error: error param present
    q_error --> [*]: redirect /login with error
    q_parse --> q_check_params: no error
    q_check_params --> q_invalid_params: code or state missing
    q_invalid_params --> [*]: redirect /login?error=invalid_callback
    q_check_params --> q_csrf_check: code and state present
    q_csrf_check --> q_load_cookies: read oauth_state, oauth_code_verifier from cookies
    q_load_cookies --> q_state_mismatch: state != savedState
    q_state_mismatch --> [*]: redirect /login?error=invalid_state
    q_load_cookies --> q_no_verifier: codeVerifier missing
    q_no_verifier --> [*]: redirect /login?error=missing_verifier
    q_load_cookies --> q_token_exchange: state matches and verifier exists
    q_token_exchange --> q_token_fail: POST to oauthBaseUrl/token fails
    q_token_fail --> [*]: redirect /login with token error
    q_token_exchange --> q_userinfo: token exchange succeeds, got access_token
    q_userinfo --> q_userinfo_fail: GET oauthBaseUrl/userinfo fails
    q_userinfo_fail --> [*]: redirect /login?error=userinfo_failed
    q_userinfo --> q_upsert: userinfo retrieved
    q_upsert --> q_save_session: upsert user to public.users table
    q_save_session --> q_cleanup: set oauth_access_token and oauth_user_id in cookies
    q_cleanup --> q_done: delete oauth_state and oauth_code_verifier cookies
    q_done --> [*]: redirect to /

    note right of q_csrf_check
        INV-001: state parameter must match cookie-stored value (CSRF protection)
        INV-002: PKCE code_verifier must be present for token exchange
        INV-003: access_token stored in httpOnly cookie with 1-hour expiry
        INV-004: client_secret is sent in token exchange (confidential client)
    end note
